OTEw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quarkusio/quarkus/labels/area/config","name":"area/config","color":"0366d6","default":false,"description":""}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignee":{"login":"gwenneg","id":10584698,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwNTg0Njk4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10584698?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gwenneg","html_url":"https://github.com/gwenneg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gwenneg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gwenneg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gwenneg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gwenneg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gwenneg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gwenneg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gwenneg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gwenneg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gwenneg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"assignees":[{"login":"gwenneg","id":10584698,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwNTg0Njk4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10584698?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gwenneg","html_url":"https://github.com/gwenneg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gwenneg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gwenneg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gwenneg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gwenneg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gwenneg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gwenneg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gwenneg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gwenneg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gwenneg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}],"milestone":null,"comments":25,"created_at":"2019-10-15T11:18:53Z","updated_at":"2020-09-15T14:23:44Z","closed_at":"2019-12-06T14:37:36Z","author_association":"MEMBER","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"As seen during #4525 development, `CORSConfig` cannot be represented as YAML because we'd need the `quarkus.http.cors` key to be both the key of a key/value pair and the key of a dictionary, which is not possible.\r\n\r\nA properties-based CORS filter configuration currently looks like this:\r\n```\r\nquarkus.http.cors=true\r\nquarkus.http.cors.origins=http://foo.com,http://www.bar.io\r\nquarkus.http.cors.methods=GET,PUT,POST\r\nquarkus.http.cors.headers=X-Custom\r\nquarkus.http.cors.exposed-headers=Content-Disposition\r\nquarkus.http.cors.access-control-max-age=24H\r\n```\r\n\r\nWe only need to change the `quarkus.http.cors=true` property to `quarkus.http.cors.enabled=true` to make it convertible to YAML.","closed_by":{"login":"dmlloyd","id":124581,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyNDU4MQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/124581?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dmlloyd","html_url":"https://github.com/dmlloyd","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dmlloyd/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dmlloyd/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dmlloyd/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dmlloyd/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dmlloyd/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dmlloyd/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dmlloyd/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dmlloyd/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dm